{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-validatefeatureslotstfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: ValidateFeatureSlots<TFeatures>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ValidateFeatureSlots<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? object : { [K in keyof TFeatures as K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? K : never]: K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? [Extract<FeatureSlotPrereqs[K], keyof TFeatures>] extends [never] ? `Error: '${K & string}' requires '${FeatureSlotPrereqs[K] & string}' to be included in this table's features.` : TFeatures[K] : never };","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L161","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types/TableFeatures.ts:161"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Validates that every row model and fn registry slot in a features object is\naccompanied by its prerequisite feature."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Slots whose prerequisite is missing have their type replaced with a literal\nerror message, so the offending property fails to type-check with a message\nnaming the feature that needs to be added."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-validatefeatureslotstfeatures","text":"Type Alias: ValidateFeatureSlots<TFeatures>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: ValidateFeatureSlots\\<TFeatures\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ValidateFeatureSlots<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? object : { [K in keyof TFeatures as K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? K : never]: K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? [Extract<FeatureSlotPrereqs[K], keyof TFeatures>] extends [never] ? `Error: '${K & string}' requires '${FeatureSlotPrereqs[K] & string}' to be included in this table's features.` : TFeatures[K] : never };\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:161](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L161)\n\nValidates that every row model and fn registry slot in a features object is\naccompanied by its prerequisite feature.\n\nSlots whose prerequisite is missing have their type replaced with a literal\nerror message, so the offending property fails to type-check with a message\nnaming the feature that needs to be added.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ValidateFeatureSlots\ntitle: ValidateFeatureSlots\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ValidateFeatureSlots\\<TFeatures\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ValidateFeatureSlots<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? object : { [K in keyof TFeatures as K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? K : never]: K extends keyof FeatureSlotPrereqs ? [Extract<FeatureSlotPrereqs[K], keyof TFeatures>] extends [never] ? `Error: '${K & string}' requires '${FeatureSlotPrereqs[K] & string}' to be included in this table's features.` : TFeatures[K] : never };\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:161](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L161)\n\nValidates that every row model and fn registry slot in a features object is\naccompanied by its prerequisite feature.\n\nSlots whose prerequisite is missing have their type replaced with a literal\nerror message, so the offending property fails to type-check with a message\nnaming the feature that needs to be added.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n"}
